msgid "The AO corrects every frame; when it passes the bump point of its travel, the mount takes over in small moves. The AO is calibrated after the mount."
msgstr "AO opravuje každý snímok; keď prejde bod dorovnania svojho rozsahu, prevezme to montáž malými posunmi. AO sa kalibruje po montáži."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Clear AO calibration"
msgstr "Vymazať kalibráciu AO"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Adaptive optics"
msgstr "Adaptívna optika"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Port"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Other computers"
msgstr "Iné počítače"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Allow them to connect"
msgstr "Povoliť im pripojenie"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "PHD2-compatible server"
msgstr "Server kompatibilný s PHD2"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Learns the mount's periodic error while guiding and corrects it before it shows: for mounts with a regular worm error. It trains for two worm periods."
msgstr "Počas pointácie sa učí periodickú chybu montáže a opravuje ju skôr, než sa prejaví: pre montáže s pravidelnou chybou závitovky. Učí sa počas dvoch periód závitovky."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Starts learning when guiding starts."
msgstr "Začne sa učiť, keď začne pointácia."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Predicting, period {0:0} s"
msgstr "Predpovedá, perióda {0:0} s"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Training: {0:0.0} of 2 periods"
msgstr "Učenie: {0:0.0} z 2 periód"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Listening on port {0} · {1} connected"
msgstr "Počúva na porte {0} · pripojené {1}"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "AO steps"
msgstr "Kroky AO"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "The AO moved by hand the same way, along its own axes, to check it."
msgstr "Posunie AO ručne rovnakým spôsobom, pozdĺž jej vlastných osí, na kontrolu."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "AO moved. Choose a guide star to see how far it moves."
msgstr "AO posunutá. Zvoľte pointačnú hviezdu, aby ste videli, ako ďaleko sa posunie."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "⚠ The AO calibration expected {0:0.0} px towards {1:0}°. Calibrate the AO again."
msgstr "⚠ Kalibrácia AO očakávala {0:0.0} px smerom {1:0}°. Kalibrujte AO znova."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Three-point (plate solving)"
msgstr "Trojbodové (astrometria)"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Drift alignment"
msgstr "Nastavenie driftom"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Static polar alignment"
msgstr "Statické polárne nastavenie"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Polar drift alignment"
msgstr "Nastavenie polárnym driftom"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "PHD2 is connected: these methods use Sidralune's own guider."
msgstr "PHD2 je pripojené: tieto metódy používajú vlastný pointér Sidralune."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Stop guiding first: the mount only tracks for this method."
msgstr "Najprv zastavte pointáciu: pri tejto metóde montáž len sleduje oblohu."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Guide frames show here. Connect a guide camera in Observatory → Equipment."
msgstr "Tu sa zobrazujú pointačné snímky. Pripojte pointačnú kameru v Pozorovanie → Vybavenie."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Sidralune guides with the Dec corrections held back, and the Dec drift tells the polar axis's error: near the meridian and the celestial equator the azimuth error, 25–35° up in the east or west the altitude error. Adjust, measure again, until both are small."
msgstr "Sidralune pointuje so zadržanými korekciami Dec a drift v Dec prezradí chybu polárnej osi: blízko meridiánu a nebeského rovníka chybu azimutu, 25–35° nad obzorom na východe či západe chybu výšky. Upravte, zmerajte znova, kým nie sú obe malé."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Start over"
msgstr "Začať znova"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Altitude error: not measured yet"
msgstr "Chyba výšky: zatiaľ nemeraná"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Altitude error {0:+0.0;-0.0}′"
msgstr "Chyba výšky {0:+0.0;-0.0}′"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Azimuth error: not measured yet"
msgstr "Chyba azimutu: zatiaľ nemeraná"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Azimuth error {0:+0.0;-0.0}′"
msgstr "Chyba azimutu {0:+0.0;-0.0}′"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Too short to tell: measure for a minute or two."
msgstr "Príliš krátke, aby sa dalo niečo povedať: merajte minútu alebo dve."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Guiding stopped, so the measurement was dropped."
msgstr "Pointácia sa zastavila, takže meranie sa zahodilo."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Connect the mount: drift alignment needs to know where it points."
msgstr "Pripojte montáž: nastavenie driftom musí vedieť, kam mieri."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "altitude error {0:+0.0;-0.0}′ ± {1:0.0}′"
msgstr "chyba výšky {0:+0.0;-0.0}′ ± {1:0.0}′"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "azimuth error {0:+0.0;-0.0}′ ± {1:0.0}′"
msgstr "chyba azimutu {0:+0.0;-0.0}′ ± {1:0.0}′"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "{0:0} s: Dec drift {1:+0.00;-0.00}″/min ± {2:0.00}"
msgstr "{0:0} s: drift v Dec {1:+0.00;-0.00}″/min ± {2:0.00}"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Turning RA"
msgstr "Otáčanie RA"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "The mount turns itself"
msgstr "Montáž otáča sama"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Point near the celestial pole. Sidralune takes a frame, turns RA about 15° west twice and plate-solves each frame: the mount's axis is the point the frames turn about, and the plate solution places the refracted pole. Then turn the altitude and azimuth knobs until the star reaches its circle."
msgstr "Mierte blízko nebeského pólu. Sidralune urobí snímok, dvakrát otočí RA asi o 15° na západ a každý snímok astrometricky vyrieši: os montáže je bod, okolo ktorého sa snímky otáčajú, a astrometrické riešenie umiestni refrakciou posunutý pól. Potom otáčajte skrutkami výšky a azimutu, kým hviezda nedosiahne svoj kruh."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Start alignment"
msgstr "Spustiť nastavenie"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Next frame"
msgstr "Ďalší snímok"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Mount axis"
msgstr "Os montáže"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Pole"
msgstr "Pól"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Turn RA about {0:0}° west, then click Next frame."
msgstr "Otočte RA asi o {0:0}° na západ a kliknite na Ďalší snímok."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "The star is not found: turn the knobs more slowly, or click Start alignment again."
msgstr "Hviezda sa nenašla: otáčajte skrutkami pomalšie, alebo znova kliknite na Spustiť nastavenie."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Turn the altitude and azimuth knobs until the star is in its circle: {0:0.0}′ to go."
msgstr "Otáčajte skrutkami výšky a azimutu, kým hviezda nie je vo svojom kruhu: zostáva {0:0.0}′."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Mirrored (an off-axis guider's prism, a diagonal)"
msgstr "Zrkadlový (hranol mimoosovej pointácie, zenitový hranol)"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Point near the celestial pole. With the mount only tracking, a star is followed: its drift gives the polar axis's error, with no calibration and no plate solving. Stop when the error has settled, then move the star into its circle with the altitude and azimuth knobs."
msgstr "Mierte blízko nebeského pólu. Kým montáž len sleduje oblohu, sleduje sa hviezda: jej drift dáva chybu polárnej osi, bez kalibrácie a bez astrometrického riešenia. Zastavte, keď sa chyba ustáli, a potom skrutkami výšky a azimutu presuňte hviezdu do jej kruhu."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Follow a star"
msgstr "Sledovať hviezdu"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Too short to tell: follow the star for a minute or two."
msgstr "Príliš krátke, aby sa dalo niečo povedať: sledujte hviezdu minútu alebo dve."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Polar alignment error {0:0.0}′ ± {1:0.0}′"
msgstr "Chyba polárneho nastavenia {0:0.0}′ ± {1:0.0}′"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Move the star into its circle with the altitude and azimuth knobs."
msgstr "Skrutkami výšky a azimutu presuňte hviezdu do jej kruhu."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "From the guider's calibration."
msgstr "Z kalibrácie pointéra."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Without a calibration, say whether the guide camera sees a mirror image."
msgstr "Bez kalibrácie uveďte, či pointačná kamera vidí zrkadlový obraz."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Following the star… {0} frames so far."
msgstr "Sledovanie hviezdy… zatiaľ {0} snímok."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "{0:0} s: error {1:0.0}′ ± {2:0.0}′. Stop when it has settled."
msgstr "{0:0} s: chyba {1:0.0}′ ± {2:0.0}′. Zastavte, keď sa ustáli."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.cs
msgid "Connect a guide camera in Observatory → Equipment, or click Connect PHD2."
msgstr "Pripojte pointačnú kameru v zobrazení Pozorovanie → Vybavenie, alebo kliknite na Pripojiť PHD2."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/CalibrationAssistant.cs
msgid "No telescope connected: the assistant needs to know where the mount points and to slew it."
msgstr "Nie je pripojený ďalekohľad: asistent potrebuje vedieť, kam montáž mieri, a otáčať ju."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/CalibrationAssistant.cs
msgid "The mount does not report its guide rate. 0.5× sidereal or faster is best."
msgstr "Montáž neuvádza svoju pointačnú rýchlosť. Najlepšia je 0,5× siderická alebo viac."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/CalibrationAssistant.cs
msgid "The guide rate is {0:0.0#}× sidereal. 0.5× or faster calibrates and guides better."
msgstr "Pointačná rýchlosť je {0:0.0#}× siderická. Pri 0,5× alebo viac je kalibrácia aj pointácia lepšia."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/CalibrationAssistant.cs
msgid "The calibration step is fixed at {0} ms. 0 works it out for the place and the guide rate."
msgstr "Krok kalibrácie je pevne {0} ms. Hodnota 0 ho určí podľa miesta a pointačnej rýchlosti."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/CalibrationAssistant.cs
msgid "The assistant has not moved the mount."
msgstr "Asistent montážou nepohol."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidingAssistant.cs
msgid "Start guiding first: the Guiding Assistant measures while guiding is paused."
